        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend this company! From quality to great customer service, I give this company a 5 star! A special thank you to Samuel Barrière  for his great service, patience and helpfulness! Loving my new home!",
        "time": 1720185437,
