        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The reason I bought new is because I wanted everything to be perfect. The kitchen Island Is not straight.  The kitchen ventilation fan is not centered. If i want them to fix it, the kitchen would have to be redone. Countertop in one of the counters is too short. Elevator is not ready.  I got the keys 1 month ago, can't move In because delivery services only deliver up to 3 floors. They should give me some compensation. Half a millon dollar is a lot of money for  an imperfect kitchen. They probably used a student put together the cabinets. There were other issues but were taken care of . I had bought From Sylvain Menard 13years ago. They were excellent I would buy from them again.",
        "time": 1685850222,
        "translated": false
      },
